 The contributions are:
 
-(1) \textbf{Controlled stage-allocation evidence.} A complete six-condition, 300-object matrix combines four equal-applied-budget controls for stage allocation with two separate fixed-strength controls (Table~\ref{tab:matched-budget300}). It rejects a generally preferred middle window; activation-dependent residuals limit further mechanism attribution.
